From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] redate: add a native interactive timestamp rewrite

Reuse matching commits from evolution history so exact signed
timestamps remain stable across repeated and away-and-back rewrites.
Preserve descendant metadata and signature state, and cover the
collision path with deterministic SSH signing.

